src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.3cf4797d210be4c9:
Alfa Romeo Giulia iz 2021. godine stigla je u naš auto servis u Beogradu na redovan servis. Nismo se zadržali samo na zameni ulja, već smo zamenili sve potrošne delove i servisirali automatski menjač.

Šta smo uradili:

- zamenili smo svećice;
- zamenili smo motorno ulje;
- zamenili smo filter ulja;
- zamenili smo filter vazduha;
- zamenili smo filter kabine;
- zamenili smo kompletan karter automatskog menjača;
- zamenili smo ulje u automatskom menjaču ZF 8HP.

Posebno smo se posvetili menjaču. Kod automatskih menjača **ZF 8HP** važno je redovno proveravati stanje ulja i kartera i ne odlagati servis. Menjač koji se održava na vreme znatno je jeftiniji za održavanje od menjača koji mora da se popravlja.

src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.801033872ff819b1:
A 2021 Alfa Romeo Giulia came to our Belgrade workshop for scheduled maintenance. We went beyond a simple oil change, replacing all the service items and servicing the automatic transmission as well.

Work carried out:

- replaced the spark plugs;
- changed the engine oil;
- replaced the oil filter;
- replaced the air filter;
- replaced the cabin air filter;
- replaced the automatic transmission pan assembly;
- changed the oil in the ZF 8HP automatic transmission.

We paid special attention to the transmission. On **ZF 8HP** automatics, it's important to keep an eye on the oil and pan condition and not put off servicing. A transmission serviced on time costs considerably less than one that needs repairs.

src/content/works/audi-q7/index.md.61ca5c4900815355:
A 2008 Audi Q7 came in with a long list of issues. It needed significant work on both the suspension and the engine.

Work carried out:

- replaced the suspension control arms;
- replaced the brake discs and pads;
- carried out repairs in the engine valley;
- resealed the intake system;
- replaced the EGR pipe;
- performed a minor service, including an oil and filter change.

There was also a persistent engine oil leak. The previous service had left the drain plug incorrectly fitted, causing oil to drip continuously from the engine. We fixed the issue and got everything back in order.

The first-generation Audi Q7 needs proper maintenance, especially older, high-mileage vehicles. It's important to find out what's causing a fault and fix the underlying problem, rather than simply fitting a new part.

src/content/works/audi-q7/index.md.e018dace5fe9f422:
U CarLab nam je stigao Audi Q7 iz 2008. godine sa podužim spiskom kvarova. Automobilu je bila potrebna ozbiljna popravka trapa i motora.

Šta smo uradili:

- zamenili smo ramena trapa;
- zamenili smo kočione diskove i pločice;
- radili smo u prostoru između redova cilindara motora;
- zamenili smo zaptivke usisnog sistema;
- zamenili smo EGR cev;
- uradili smo mali servis, zamenili ulje i filtere.

Poseban problem bilo je stalno curenje motornog ulja. Posle prethodnog servisa, čep za ispuštanje ulja nije bio pravilno postavljen, pa je ulje neprestano kapalo iz motora. Otklonili smo problem i sve doveli u red.

Audi Q7 prve generacije zahteva stručno održavanje, naročito kada je reč o starijim automobilima sa velikom kilometražom. Važno je utvrditi uzrok kvara i otkloniti ga, a ne samo ugraditi novi deo.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.b58d2bd924b1cca3:
Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 je došao u naš auto servis u Beogradu na mali servis.

Uradili smo:

- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu filtera za ulje;
- zamenu filtera vazduha motora;
- zamenu filtera kabine;
- zamenu svih kočionih pločica;
- servis i proveru kočionog sistema.

Posebno o kočnicama. Pločice su jedan od ključnih elemenata bezbednosti i treba ih redovno proveravati. Kada menjamo pločice, uvek proverimo i **diskove, čeljusti i vođice**: ako je nešto od toga zapeklo ili istrošeno, automobil neće ravnomerno kočiti.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.bd240cfdb45ade29:
A Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 came to our Belgrade garage for a minor service.

We carried out:

- engine oil change;
- oil filter replacement;
- engine air filter replacement;
- cabin air filter replacement;
- replacement of all brake pads;
- brake system inspection and servicing.

A note about the brakes: brake pads are a key safety component, so they need to be checked regularly. Whenever we replace the pads, we also inspect the **discs, calipers and guide pins**. If any of these are seized or worn, the car may not brake evenly.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.1bcd91c5595de1ef:
MINI Cooper SD sa dizel motorom **2.0 B47 od 170 KS** stigao je u naš auto servis u Beogradu na kompletan servis.

Uradili smo:

- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu svih filtera;
- zamenu filtera goriva;
- zamenu ulja u Aisin automatskom menjaču sa 8 brzina;
- kompjutersku dijagnostiku motora i elektronskih sistema;
- proveru usisnog sistema.

Filter goriva na dizelašu treba menjati najmanje na svakih **20.000 km**. Tako se štiti sistem za gorivo i obezbeđuje stabilan rad motora.

Prilikom provere usisnog sistema utvrdili smo da je dosta zaprljan: vrtložne klapne bile su prekrivene debelim slojem čađi i naslaga. Predložili smo vlasniku čišćenje, on je prihvatio, pa smo usisni sistem temeljno očistili.

Dizel motor B47 u vozilima BMW i MINI, Aisin automatski menjač i usisni sistem zahtevaju redovno održavanje: pravovremenu zamenu ulja i filtera i redovnu proveru usisnog sistema. Tako se skupe popravke mogu odložiti na duže vreme.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.34345344c0c54ceb:
This MINI Cooper SD with a **2.0 B47 diesel engine producing 170 hp** came to our Belgrade garage for a full service.

We carried out:

- engine oil change;
- replacement of all filters;
- fuel filter replacement;
- oil change in the 8-speed Aisin automatic transmission;
- computer diagnostics of the engine and electronic systems;
- intake system inspection.

The fuel filter on a diesel should be replaced at least every **20,000 km** to protect the fuel system and keep the engine running smoothly.

The intake inspection revealed heavy buildup: the swirl flaps were covered in soot and carbon deposits. We recommended cleaning, the owner agreed, and we thoroughly cleaned the entire intake system.

The B47 diesel in BMW and MINI models, the Aisin automatic transmission, and the intake system all benefit from regular maintenance: change the oil and filters on time, and keep an eye on the intake system. This can help put off expensive repairs for a long time.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.375f26e39cba7c37:
U naš auto servis u Beogradu dovezli su automobil zbog **vibracija pri kočenju**: vozač pritisne pedalu i automobil počne da se trese.

Počeli smo od balansiranja točkova. To je najčešći uzrok ovakvih vibracija i najlakše ga je isključiti. Balansiranje je bilo u redu, pa smo nastavili proveru kočionog sistema.

Diskovi i pločice na prvi pogled bili su u redu, bez očiglednih tragova jakog habanja. Pažljivom proverom utvrdili smo da je **levi kočioni disk deformisan**. On je izazivao vibracije.

Pokazali smo klijentu šta smo utvrdili i dogovorili popravku. Uradili smo sledeće:

- dijagnostikovali smo kočioni sistem;
- proverili i balansirali točkove;
- utvrdili deformaciju levog kočionog diska;
- zamenili kočione diskove;
- zamenili kočione pločice;
- ponovo proverili balansiranje točkova;
- obavili probnu vožnju nakon popravke.

Vibracije pri kočenju su potpuno nestale. Proverili smo automobil i predali ga vlasniku.

Disk može da izgleda normalno, a da ipak bude iskrivljen. Takvu deformaciju nije moguće uočiti golim okom. Zato, ako primetite da volan podrhtava ili da pedala ili karoserija vibriraju pri kočenju, nemojte odlagati dijagnostiku.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.63ba435f575b1937:
A car came into our Belgrade garage with a complaint of **vibration when braking**: the driver presses the pedal and the car starts to shake.

We started by balancing the wheels. It's the most common cause of this kind of vibration and the easiest one to rule out. The wheels were balanced correctly, so we moved on to the braking system.

The discs and pads looked fine, with no obvious signs of heavy wear. A closer inspection revealed that **the left brake disc was warped**. That was causing the vibration.

We showed the customer what we found and agreed on the repair. Here's what we did:

- inspected the braking system;
- checked and balanced the wheels;
- found a warped left brake disc;
- replaced the brake discs;
- replaced the brake pads;
- rechecked wheel balance;
- took the car for a test drive after the repair.

The vibration when braking disappeared completely. We checked the car and handed it back to the owner.

A disc can look fine and still be warped. You can't spot this kind of distortion by eye. If you notice the steering wheel, brake pedal or car body vibrating when you brake, it's best not to put off having it checked.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.0e959b63e01a1faf:
Peugeot 308 iz 2024. godine sa dizel motorom **1.5 BlueHDi** došao je kod nas u ruski auto servis u Beogradu na veliki servis. Uradili smo kompletan servis:

- zamenili smo zupčasti kaiš;
- zamenili smo vodenu pumpu;
- zamenili smo antifriz;
- zamenili smo motorno ulje;
- zamenili smo filtere;
- proverili smo i servisirali sve prateće komponente.

Kod motora 1.5 BlueHDi postoji jedna stvar na koju posebno treba obratiti pažnju: lanac koji pokreće bregaste osovine. Na ranijim verzijama motora ugrađivan je lanac širine **7 mm**. Vremenom se istegne, a u najgorem slučaju može da pukne i izazove ozbiljno oštećenje motora.

Prilikom servisiranja ovih motora preporučuje se ugradnja ojačanog lanca širine **8 mm**, zajedno sa posteljom bregastih osovina i samim bregastim osovinama. Peugeot 308 iz 2023. i 2024. godine već fabrički ima lanac od 8 mm.

Zato na velikom servisu treba proveriti ne samo zupčasti kaiš već i lanac bregastih osovina, kao i poznate specifičnosti konkretnog motora.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.f8df4d13d5c869ff:
This 2024 Peugeot 308 with a **1.5 BlueHDi** diesel engine came to our Russian-speaking garage in Belgrade for a major service. We carried out a full service:

- replaced the timing belt;
- replaced the water pump;
- replaced the coolant;
- changed the engine oil;
- replaced the filters;
- checked and serviced all related components.

There is one important detail to know about the 1.5 BlueHDi engine: the camshaft drive chain. Early versions of the engine had a **7 mm** chain. Over time, it stretches and, in the worst case, can break and cause severe engine damage.

When servicing these engines, it's recommended to fit the upgraded **8 mm** chain, along with the camshaft carrier and camshafts. The 8 mm chain was fitted at the factory on 2023-2024 Peugeot 308 models.

So during a major service, it's important to check not only the timing belt, but also the camshaft chain and other known issues specific to the engine.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.3ba3562f605fd26f:
Seat Leon sa **190.000 km** na satu dovezli su nam u ruski auto servis u Beogradu na veliki servis.

Na ovoj kilometraži najbolje je odmah zameniti sve što je potrebno, pa smo uradili:

- zamenili komplet zupčastog kaiša;
- zamenili pumpu za vodu;
- zamenili antifriz;
- zamenili motorno ulje;
- zamenili sve potrebne filtere;
- zamenili zadnje amortizere;
- zamenili ulje u menjaču DSG DQ250.

Kod vozila Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda i Audi veliki servis je jedan od ključnih zahvata održavanja. Pravovremena zamena zupčastog kaiša, pumpe, tehničkih tečnosti i potrošnih delova pomaže da se kasnije izbegnu mnogo skuplji kvarovi.

Posebno da pomenemo **DQ250**. To je šestostepeni menjač sa dvostrukim kvačilom u uljnom kupatilu. Ulje u njemu treba menjati prema propisanom intervalu, jer je to važno za dug vek menjača.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.c2bdd563c8d47d3d:
This Seat Leon came to our Russian-speaking garage in Belgrade for a major scheduled service at **190,000 km**.

At this mileage, it's best to service the main components all at once, so we carried out:

- timing belt kit replacement;
- water pump replacement;
- coolant replacement;
- engine oil change;
- replacement of all required filters;
- rear shock absorber replacement;
- DSG DQ250 transmission oil change.

For Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda and Audi, a major service is an important maintenance milestone. Replacing the timing belt, water pump, fluids and consumables on time helps prevent much more expensive problems down the road.

A note on the **DQ250**: it's a six-speed dual-clutch transmission with wet clutches. The transmission oil needs to be changed according to the service schedule. That's what keeps the gearbox running properly.
